1
00:00:00,009 --> 00:00:01,432
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,433 --> 00:00:03,000
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,209 --> 00:00:05,452
(Episode 60)

4
00:00:12,345 --> 00:00:13,345
Ji Ni.

5
00:00:32,045 --> 00:00:33,730
911? There's...

6
00:00:34,281 --> 00:00:36,022
There's been an accident here.

7
00:00:36,242 --> 00:00:38,145
(Haemyeong University Hospital)

8
00:00:38,147 --> 00:00:39,912
(In Surgery)

9
00:00:53,458 --> 00:00:55,535
What on earth happened?

10
00:00:56,932 --> 00:00:59,915
Ji Hu won't die like this, will he?

11
00:01:00,558 --> 00:01:01,799
That can't happen.

12
00:01:02,632 --> 00:01:03,991
It can't.

13
00:01:04,579 --> 00:01:06,305
He can't die because of me.

14
00:01:08,232 --> 00:01:09,732
That can't happen.

15
00:01:10,632 --> 00:01:12,809
Why did that bitch Do Hee cause all this?

16
00:01:14,166 --> 00:01:15,232
Do Do Hee.

17
00:01:17,691 --> 00:01:19,445
You need to get checked out too.

18
00:01:19,988 --> 00:01:21,597
No, I'm okay.

19
00:01:22,312 --> 00:01:23,312
Do Hee...

20
00:01:23,577 --> 00:01:24,914
Where's Do Do Hee?

21
00:01:26,523 --> 00:01:27,523
Ji Ni.

22
00:01:27,861 --> 00:01:29,509
Hello. You're here.

23
00:01:30,022 --> 00:01:31,022
What do you mean?

24
00:01:31,242 --> 00:01:33,059
Ji Hu was in an accident?

25
00:01:33,084 --> 00:01:34,409
What happened?

26
00:01:34,812 --> 00:01:36,402
Why did this happen to Ji Hu?

27
00:01:36,619 --> 00:01:39,701
Do Hee hit Ji Hu and Ji Ni with her car.

28
00:01:39,721 --> 00:01:40,721
What?

29
00:01:41,512 --> 00:01:43,680
- Why would Do Hee do that?
- Ji Hu...

30
00:01:44,172 --> 00:01:46,055
was trying to save me...

31
00:01:47,055 --> 00:01:48,055
I'm sorry.

32
00:01:48,394 --> 00:01:50,404
I don't understand what happened either.

33
00:01:50,749 --> 00:01:52,599
Where's Do Hee? No...

34
00:01:53,005 --> 00:01:54,676
Where's Ji Hu?

35
00:01:55,059 --> 00:01:56,170
Is he badly hurt?

36
00:01:56,611 --> 00:01:58,586
They just took him into surgery.

37
00:02:01,226 --> 00:02:02,226
Honey.

38
00:02:03,643 --> 00:02:04,643
What's his condition?

39
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:07,083
I don't know.

40
00:02:13,518 --> 00:02:14,518
Ji Ni.

41
00:02:42,568 --> 00:02:43,953
Earlier, on the phone,

42
00:02:44,622 --> 00:02:46,748
you asked if Do Do Hee had come to me.

43
00:02:47,358 --> 00:02:49,060
Did you know this would happen?

44
00:02:49,433 --> 00:02:51,100
No...

45
00:02:51,940 --> 00:02:52,940
Actually...

46
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:55,631
I was worried she might.

47
00:02:55,858 --> 00:02:57,326
She was furious when she left,

48
00:02:57,543 --> 00:03:00,799
and I felt something was wrong,
so I called to see if she'd come to you.

49
00:03:00,817 --> 00:03:02,665
Do Do Hee tried to kill me.

50
00:03:03,124 --> 00:03:04,906
If Ji Hu hadn't pushed me out of the way,

51
00:03:05,852 --> 00:03:08,088
that car would've crushed me to death.

52
00:03:08,812 --> 00:03:10,276
I still can't stop shaking.

53
00:03:11,112 --> 00:03:13,400
- Really?
- She's really lost her mind.

54
00:03:13,619 --> 00:03:14,912
She's completely insane.

55
00:03:17,638 --> 00:03:18,638
Ji Ni.

56
00:03:19,024 --> 00:03:20,104
Jung A.

57
00:03:20,585 --> 00:03:21,892
Were you there too?

58
00:03:22,344 --> 00:03:24,178
I only saw them after the accident.

59
00:03:24,203 --> 00:03:27,736
As Ji Ni said, Ji Hu got hurt
trying to save her.

60
00:03:38,995 --> 00:03:40,995
(Emergency Care Area)

61
00:03:48,118 --> 00:03:49,118
Hey.

62
00:03:49,716 --> 00:03:50,716
Wake up.

63
00:03:50,983 --> 00:03:52,166
I said wake up!

64
00:03:52,512 --> 00:03:54,136
Why are you doing this to me?

65
00:03:54,337 --> 00:03:57,583
- Why would you go this far?
- You can't do this!

66
00:03:57,837 --> 00:03:59,259
She's resting right now.

67
00:04:00,567 --> 00:04:01,567
Ji Ni.

68
00:04:02,592 --> 00:04:05,228
You could be arrested
for disrupting emergency care.

69
00:04:05,938 --> 00:04:07,138
Did you witness the crash?

70
00:04:07,163 --> 00:04:08,810
I'm a victim, not a witness.

71
00:04:09,085 --> 00:04:11,985
I'd be dead if the man in surgery
hadn't saved me.

72
00:04:12,158 --> 00:04:13,528
We'll investigate that.

73
00:04:13,632 --> 00:04:15,189
How do you know the driver?

74
00:04:15,213 --> 00:04:16,236
She's my enemy.

75
00:04:16,260 --> 00:04:17,759
My worst enemy!

76
00:04:19,231 --> 00:04:20,698
That's not it.

77
00:04:21,281 --> 00:04:22,513
Please speak to me.

78
00:04:22,771 --> 00:04:24,862
We're identifying the injured person
and the driver...

79
00:04:24,886 --> 00:04:26,448
and investigating the accident.

80
00:04:26,472 --> 00:04:28,428
Let's go outside and take your statement.

81
00:04:28,453 --> 00:04:30,482
I said I'm a victim, not a witness!

82
00:04:30,769 --> 00:04:33,113
This isn't the first time
she's tried to kill me!

83
00:04:33,125 --> 00:04:35,036
Investigate all of it!

84
00:04:38,352 --> 00:04:41,305
You seem agitated. Please come
to the station once you've calmed down.

85
00:04:45,725 --> 00:04:47,793
- Is the injured man out of surgery?
- Not yet.

86
00:04:47,825 --> 00:04:50,027
Everyone, please leave.
I'll let you know when she wakes up.

87
00:04:50,052 --> 00:04:51,177
She needs treatment too.

88
00:04:51,179 --> 00:04:52,610
No, I'm fine.

89
00:04:53,778 --> 00:04:55,609
I'll come back when he wakes up
after surgery.

90
00:04:55,633 --> 00:04:56,805
I'm fine for now.

91
00:05:14,765 --> 00:05:16,018
I said leave.

92
00:05:51,931 --> 00:05:53,921
Wait here. I'll get you some water.

93
00:06:00,665 --> 00:06:03,765
The police will uncover the truth
through their investigation.

94
00:06:03,793 --> 00:06:05,131
Are you close to Do Do Hee?

95
00:06:05,924 --> 00:06:07,341
I wouldn't say we're close.

96
00:06:07,645 --> 00:06:09,273
We just met while working on a shoot.

97
00:06:09,298 --> 00:06:11,945
Still, you had a bad feeling,
so you called me.

98
00:06:12,988 --> 00:06:14,306
That's right.

99
00:06:14,952 --> 00:06:16,642
But I didn't expect anything like this.

100
00:06:16,755 --> 00:06:18,157
She must've bad-mouthed me a lot.

101
00:06:18,771 --> 00:06:20,817
- She even bad-mouthed my mom.
- I just...

102
00:06:22,074 --> 00:06:23,074
listened.

103
00:06:24,311 --> 00:06:26,887
I couldn't tell her
she was talking about my family.

104
00:06:28,145 --> 00:06:30,530
You thought I deserved it, didn't you?

105
00:06:30,554 --> 00:06:31,922
No, I didn't.

106
00:06:34,105 --> 00:06:35,326
Let's talk about this later.

107
00:06:35,723 --> 00:06:37,808
She blames me for everything.

108
00:06:38,592 --> 00:06:40,265
For being good at drawing,

109
00:06:40,665 --> 00:06:42,895
for having a dad she envied,
for going to college.

110
00:06:43,992 --> 00:06:45,437
Even now, she'll blame me.

111
00:06:46,284 --> 00:06:48,707
I should've died,
but Ji Hu got hurt instead...

112
00:06:49,425 --> 00:06:51,034
She'll think that's so unfair.

113
00:06:59,103 --> 00:07:00,212
Let's get you examined.

114
00:07:01,340 --> 00:07:02,340
No.

115
00:07:03,319 --> 00:07:05,498
Someone almost died because of me.

116
00:07:06,228 --> 00:07:07,432
How can I worry about this injury...

117
00:07:08,378 --> 00:07:11,529
Ji Hu's surgery will go well.

118
00:07:12,071 --> 00:07:15,730
Refusing treatment won't change
whether his surgery succeeds.

119
00:07:17,681 --> 00:07:19,044
Why would he do that for me...

120
00:07:21,305 --> 00:07:24,117
I can't understand
why he ran in front of the car.

121
00:07:25,698 --> 00:07:27,264
He should've just let me die.

122
00:07:27,289 --> 00:07:28,835
Don't talk nonsense.

123
00:07:31,099 --> 00:07:33,434
You said I should never have been born.

124
00:07:34,150 --> 00:07:36,347
Hey...

125
00:07:36,908 --> 00:07:37,908
That was...

126
00:07:55,518 --> 00:07:57,037
- You're awake?
- I...

127
00:07:57,061 --> 00:07:58,419
Please admit me right away.

128
00:07:58,444 --> 00:08:00,112
Don't let anyone come see me.

129
00:08:00,137 --> 00:08:02,004
Don't allow any visitors.

130
00:08:02,426 --> 00:08:04,086
Okay? Right now.

131
00:08:04,111 --> 00:08:06,512
- You need to be questioned first.
- What?

132
00:08:06,998 --> 00:08:08,089
But I'm hurt.

133
00:08:08,859 --> 00:08:10,172
I'm dizzy.

134
00:08:11,424 --> 00:08:13,689
I can't be questioned.

135
00:08:14,304 --> 00:08:16,656
Since you're awake,
we'll transfer you to a six-bed room.

136
00:08:16,681 --> 00:08:19,065
- We'll question you after your IV.
- Six beds?

137
00:08:19,332 --> 00:08:22,740
Are you crazy?
Do I look like I'd stay in such a room?

138
00:08:23,721 --> 00:08:27,443
Move me to a VIP room.

139
00:08:27,973 --> 00:08:30,437
And put up a sign saying no visitors.

140
00:08:50,092 --> 00:08:51,274
I'm dizzy.

141
00:08:53,104 --> 00:08:54,780
My head hurts so much.

142
00:08:55,570 --> 00:08:58,204
I'm really dizzy. I might throw up.

143
00:08:58,229 --> 00:09:01,324
You may have a concussion.
You need to be careful.

144
00:09:01,692 --> 00:09:02,967
Seriously!

145
00:09:08,292 --> 00:09:10,059
You're Ms. Do Do Hee, right?

146
00:09:11,208 --> 00:09:12,208
Yes.

147
00:09:12,254 --> 00:09:13,293
Have you been drinking?

148
00:09:13,437 --> 00:09:15,073
I don't really remember.

149
00:09:19,611 --> 00:09:21,885
My head hurts so much.

150
00:09:22,551 --> 00:09:25,508
Can't we do this later?
I'm not feeling well.

151
00:09:25,819 --> 00:09:27,557
Okay. We'll question you later,

152
00:09:27,581 --> 00:09:29,552
but first, we need to check for alcohol.

153
00:09:31,925 --> 00:09:34,458
I haven't been drinking.

154
00:09:34,483 --> 00:09:36,736
- I didn't have a single drink.
- Then blow into this.

155
00:09:37,978 --> 00:09:39,227
We'll also do a blood test.

156
00:09:39,252 --> 00:09:41,427
I'm telling you, I didn't drink!

157
00:09:43,451 --> 00:09:45,898
I think I broke a rib.

158
00:09:45,923 --> 00:09:48,517
My side hurts too much to blow.

159
00:09:48,542 --> 00:09:49,542
Ms. Do Do Hee,

160
00:09:49,574 --> 00:09:51,922
you know the dashcam memory card
is missing from the car, right?

161
00:09:52,079 --> 00:09:54,915
If you removed it on purpose,
that's tampering with evidence.

162
00:09:55,212 --> 00:09:57,930
Cooperate if you want to avoid
a harsher penalty.

163
00:10:06,750 --> 00:10:08,993
Wait. I'm going to throw up.

164
00:10:11,233 --> 00:10:12,418
Wait!

165
00:10:21,379 --> 00:10:22,944
This is just...

166
00:10:23,249 --> 00:10:25,048
too much.

167
00:10:26,460 --> 00:10:27,460
Just a second.

168
00:10:39,524 --> 00:10:41,865
So you drank and swallowed this too.

169
00:10:46,667 --> 00:10:47,730
Ma'am!

170
00:10:48,346 --> 00:10:49,346
Ma'am!

171
00:10:50,472 --> 00:10:51,472
Ma'am?

172
00:10:52,601 --> 00:10:53,601
What do I do?

173
00:10:54,218 --> 00:10:56,460
What? Are you serious?

174
00:10:58,585 --> 00:10:59,585
Okay.

175
00:11:00,264 --> 00:11:01,344
I'll come get you.

176
00:11:02,355 --> 00:11:03,355
Yeah.

177
00:11:13,524 --> 00:11:14,551
Yeah.

178
00:11:17,224 --> 00:11:19,115
- What are you doing?
- What?

179
00:11:19,139 --> 00:11:20,139
Practicing.

180
00:11:21,052 --> 00:11:23,623
What's up? Did you come to ask about that?

181
00:11:26,198 --> 00:11:27,478
Well...

182
00:11:28,501 --> 00:11:29,622
What's going on?

183
00:11:30,617 --> 00:11:31,797
Is this about Ji Ni?

184
00:11:33,157 --> 00:11:34,883
Spit it out. I won't freak out.

185
00:11:37,518 --> 00:11:39,834
- A car accident...
- What?

186
00:11:41,888 --> 00:11:43,208
- Are you okay?
- Yeah.

187
00:11:43,233 --> 00:11:44,877
I'm fine.

188
00:11:45,471 --> 00:11:46,543
I'm fine.

189
00:11:46,844 --> 00:11:48,010
Which hospital?

190
00:11:48,351 --> 00:11:49,732
It's not too serious,

191
00:11:50,118 --> 00:11:52,895
but Ji Hu got hurt protecting her
and is in surgery now.

192
00:11:53,473 --> 00:11:54,473
What?

193
00:12:02,812 --> 00:12:04,517
I think I should go.

194
00:12:04,542 --> 00:12:06,733
Joong Bin told us not to come.

195
00:12:07,173 --> 00:12:08,271
I've been through this myself.

196
00:12:08,296 --> 00:12:11,326
Sometimes, the best thing you can do
is to wait quietly.

197
00:12:15,164 --> 00:12:17,967
That little punk! I told him over and over
to be careful on the road.

198
00:12:17,992 --> 00:12:20,505
How are you supposed to avoid
a car coming at you?

199
00:12:22,482 --> 00:12:23,494
Seriously, Ms. Do!

200
00:12:23,519 --> 00:12:24,733
Don't call her Ms. Do!

201
00:12:25,428 --> 00:12:26,922
That bitch.

202
00:12:27,233 --> 00:12:28,809
Even if they fought,
that was going too far.

203
00:12:48,773 --> 00:12:49,829
Seriously!

204
00:12:50,158 --> 00:12:52,521
Why won't you let me go to the hospital?

205
00:12:52,546 --> 00:12:53,724
Seung Woo's there.

206
00:12:54,298 --> 00:12:56,616
He said he'd get Ji Ni treated
after Ji Hu's surgery...

207
00:12:56,715 --> 00:12:57,911
and told us to pick them up then.

208
00:12:58,871 --> 00:13:01,520
Until Ji Hu's surgery is over,

209
00:13:01,955 --> 00:13:04,565
she doesn't want anyone
to do anything for her.

210
00:13:04,566 --> 00:13:06,062
That stupid girl!

211
00:13:06,087 --> 00:13:07,651
She should put herself first!

212
00:13:08,841 --> 00:13:12,552
I should've killed that Do Do Hee
a long time ago.

213
00:13:13,124 --> 00:13:14,740
I've held back for too long.

214
00:13:16,105 --> 00:13:18,328
At least you know who did it.

215
00:13:19,398 --> 00:13:21,317
You can curse her and dream of revenge.

216
00:13:22,485 --> 00:13:24,611
I still don't know who did it.

217
00:13:25,178 --> 00:13:26,599
When I get so angry I can't stand it,

218
00:13:27,448 --> 00:13:28,803
I just curse into the void.

219
00:13:37,099 --> 00:13:39,099
(In Surgery)

220
00:13:42,117 --> 00:13:43,232
Honey.

221
00:13:49,662 --> 00:13:51,532
How is Ji Hu, Doctor?

222
00:13:51,628 --> 00:13:53,010
The surgery went well.

223
00:13:55,452 --> 00:13:57,743
He suffered a traumatic
subarachnoid hemorrhage,

224
00:13:57,968 --> 00:14:00,886
so we performed a craniotomy
to relieve the pressure...

225
00:14:01,032 --> 00:14:03,306
and completely removed the hematoma.

226
00:14:04,324 --> 00:14:06,864
When will he wake up?

227
00:14:07,057 --> 00:14:09,233
It's hard to say for sure,

228
00:14:09,723 --> 00:14:13,727
but brain hemorrhages can lead
to a prolonged coma.

229
00:14:13,967 --> 00:14:14,994
A prolonged coma?

230
00:14:15,012 --> 00:14:17,898
Let's move him to the ICU
and monitor his condition.

231
00:14:21,091 --> 00:14:22,424
What do I do? My poor Ji Hu.

232
00:14:23,100 --> 00:14:24,624
He'll recover little by little.

233
00:14:25,072 --> 00:14:27,485
All of you, go home now.

234
00:14:31,785 --> 00:14:33,597
What did you do to Ji Hu...

235
00:14:33,776 --> 00:14:35,898
that made him jump in front of a car
for you?

236
00:14:36,992 --> 00:14:38,797
If he doesn't wake up,

237
00:14:39,105 --> 00:14:40,599
you'll regret it!

238
00:14:40,672 --> 00:14:43,208
I'll make sure you and Do Hee pay!

239
00:14:43,209 --> 00:14:44,209
Ma'am.

240
00:14:44,678 --> 00:14:48,627
Stay away from my son.
You're nothing but bad luck.

241
00:14:48,798 --> 00:14:51,118
You're the daughter of a mistress.
How dare you hang around my son...

242
00:14:51,126 --> 00:14:52,998
and cause an accident like this?

243
00:14:55,858 --> 00:14:57,454
She's injured too.

244
00:14:58,340 --> 00:15:01,231
She said she'd get treatment
after his surgery...

245
00:15:03,054 --> 00:15:04,327
I'm sorry.

246
00:15:04,452 --> 00:15:05,967
You call that an injury?

247
00:15:06,665 --> 00:15:09,584
You should've died
on that operating table!

248
00:15:10,525 --> 00:15:11,690
That's enough.

249
00:15:11,718 --> 00:15:13,318
We should at least see him.

250
00:15:20,432 --> 00:15:21,432
Go.

251
00:15:22,304 --> 00:15:24,725
- Go get treated too.
- I'm really fine...

252
00:15:38,131 --> 00:15:40,437
I'm a family member
of the patient who just had surgery.

253
00:15:41,231 --> 00:15:43,158
Did the surgery go well? How is he doing?

254
00:15:43,159 --> 00:15:44,562
He's still unconscious.

255
00:15:46,331 --> 00:15:48,079
Please investigate this thoroughly.

256
00:15:49,152 --> 00:15:51,231
- There will be no settlement.
- Of course.

257
00:15:51,452 --> 00:15:53,068
We'll do everything we can.

258
00:15:53,565 --> 00:15:55,095
I'll cooperate fully.

259
00:15:56,132 --> 00:15:57,667
- May I have your card?
- Yes.

260
00:16:02,712 --> 00:16:04,781
I hope your son wakes up soon.

261
00:16:07,365 --> 00:16:09,026
Was the driver drinking?

262
00:16:09,072 --> 00:16:12,454
We're running a blood test,
but the device showed a high reading.

263
00:16:16,777 --> 00:16:18,403
(Jong No Police Station, Traffic Accident
Investigation Unit, Kang Jae Hyun)

264
00:16:19,012 --> 00:16:20,054
I knew it.

265
00:16:29,963 --> 00:16:33,132
See what contacts we have
with the Jong No police chief.

266
00:16:33,211 --> 00:16:34,776
We need to move faster than Ambassador Do.

267
00:16:35,305 --> 00:16:37,282
Get the investigation records
before they cover this up.

268
00:16:38,197 --> 00:16:39,197
Yeah.

269
00:16:46,046 --> 00:16:47,819
(No Visitors Allowed)

270
00:16:56,099 --> 00:16:57,399
What do I do...

271
00:16:58,134 --> 00:16:59,909
What do I do?

272
00:17:16,532 --> 00:17:17,717
How are you feeling?

273
00:17:18,635 --> 00:17:19,993
How's the patient who had surgery?

274
00:17:20,456 --> 00:17:21,532
He's unconscious.

275
00:17:21,567 --> 00:17:23,670
Unconscious? Why?

276
00:17:24,025 --> 00:17:26,485
- Is something wrong?
- Why do you keep asking?

277
00:17:27,838 --> 00:17:28,901
Please help me.

278
00:17:28,938 --> 00:17:30,275
I'll make it up to you.

279
00:17:30,631 --> 00:17:32,892
I'm rich. I'll pay you whatever you want.

280
00:17:33,798 --> 00:17:35,234
Could you bandage my arms and legs...

281
00:17:35,235 --> 00:17:37,159
so I can't move at all?

282
00:17:37,497 --> 00:17:38,497
Please.

283
00:17:38,918 --> 00:17:40,728
I'm begging you. Help me.

284
00:17:40,975 --> 00:17:42,098
I'll pay you a fortune.

285
00:17:42,192 --> 00:17:43,502
I'll give you my studio apartment.

286
00:17:43,677 --> 00:17:45,703
I'll give you everything. Okay?

287
00:17:46,876 --> 00:17:50,186
Please!

288
00:17:50,493 --> 00:17:52,080
Seriously...

289
00:18:15,302 --> 00:18:17,923
What do I do...

290
00:18:18,205 --> 00:18:20,778
Ji Ni, you should've stayed
in the hospital.

291
00:18:21,565 --> 00:18:22,565
Are you okay?

292
00:18:23,246 --> 00:18:24,246
I'm okay.

293
00:18:25,639 --> 00:18:26,639
Thank you.

294
00:18:48,320 --> 00:18:49,320
My goodness...

295
00:18:54,058 --> 00:18:56,405
Mom, you heard everything, right?

296
00:18:57,525 --> 00:18:59,153
I want to be alone.

297
00:19:00,098 --> 00:19:02,732
Is Ji Hu still unconscious?

298
00:19:05,204 --> 00:19:06,971
I don't have the energy to talk.

299
00:19:07,645 --> 00:19:08,857
Okay, then.

300
00:19:08,902 --> 00:19:10,163
Okay. Get some rest.

301
00:19:27,638 --> 00:19:28,862
Ji Ni!

302
00:19:44,785 --> 00:19:46,685
(Haemyeong University Hospital)

303
00:19:50,045 --> 00:19:51,809
Please have something to drink.

304
00:19:56,464 --> 00:19:57,568
General.

305
00:19:58,799 --> 00:19:59,799
You're here?

306
00:20:01,032 --> 00:20:03,372
You need to eat something
if you're going to keep waiting.

307
00:20:03,502 --> 00:20:06,282
I brought you something easy to digest,

308
00:20:06,427 --> 00:20:08,418
so please eat some in the lounge.

309
00:20:12,551 --> 00:20:14,433
I'll stay here.

310
00:20:14,438 --> 00:20:16,673
I'll call you right away
if anything happens.

311
00:20:17,214 --> 00:20:18,898
General, let's go.

312
00:20:19,290 --> 00:20:20,290
No.

313
00:20:21,597 --> 00:20:23,979
Where did Sun Kyung go?

314
00:20:23,980 --> 00:20:24,980
I'm not sure.

315
00:20:25,252 --> 00:20:26,932
She said she was going to the bathroom.

316
00:20:31,081 --> 00:20:32,420
Come on!

317
00:20:32,684 --> 00:20:33,684
Mom!

318
00:20:34,245 --> 00:20:36,415
You told me I should die!

319
00:20:36,972 --> 00:20:39,196
So I was going to kill her
and then kill myself!

320
00:20:41,585 --> 00:20:43,818
Have you ever once genuinely supported me?

321
00:20:45,725 --> 00:20:47,545
You were always comparing me to Na Ji Ni,

322
00:20:48,063 --> 00:20:50,627
mocking me and hitting me!

323
00:20:54,398 --> 00:20:55,398
Drinking?

324
00:20:58,052 --> 00:20:59,272
I did.

325
00:21:02,512 --> 00:21:03,936
Let's just say I didn't.

326
00:21:05,038 --> 00:21:08,135
If I go to the police, you and dad
will get dragged into this too.

327
00:21:08,415 --> 00:21:09,568
What do we do then?

328
00:21:10,684 --> 00:21:12,254
You gave birth to me.

329
00:21:12,612 --> 00:21:14,389
Didn't you say you got pregnant with me
to keep dad from leaving?

330
00:21:14,424 --> 00:21:15,708
Take responsibility.

331
00:21:16,445 --> 00:21:18,150
This is all your fault.

332
00:21:21,672 --> 00:21:22,735
Mother!

333
00:21:22,985 --> 00:21:24,275
Mother?

334
00:21:25,101 --> 00:21:27,057
How dare you call me Mother?

335
00:21:27,059 --> 00:21:30,997
Help! Emergency! Somebody help me!

336
00:21:30,998 --> 00:21:32,387
Somebody save me!

337
00:21:32,545 --> 00:21:34,385
How dare you hit my son?

338
00:21:34,545 --> 00:21:36,605
How dare you! Do you want to die?

339
00:21:36,798 --> 00:21:40,190
- Do you want to die?
- Mom!

340
00:21:40,192 --> 00:21:41,805
Mom, help me!

341
00:21:49,325 --> 00:21:50,806
Are you crazy?

342
00:21:51,747 --> 00:21:52,747
What?

343
00:21:53,321 --> 00:21:54,342
Hey!

344
00:21:55,974 --> 00:21:57,916
I knew it.

345
00:21:57,918 --> 00:21:59,691
You're lying again, aren't you?

346
00:22:01,145 --> 00:22:03,138
- Ma'am!
- She's lying!

347
00:22:04,514 --> 00:22:07,142
Why are you stopping me?

348
00:22:07,447 --> 00:22:09,633
My son is unconscious right now,
and this bitch...

349
00:22:09,634 --> 00:22:11,511
was begging her own mom to save her.

350
00:22:12,025 --> 00:22:14,004
How am I supposed to stay calm?

351
00:22:14,491 --> 00:22:16,218
This will put the General
at a disadvantage.

352
00:22:16,372 --> 00:22:17,618
Please leave this to us.

353
00:22:19,932 --> 00:22:22,378
What are you standing around for?
Get them all out!

354
00:22:22,458 --> 00:22:23,829
Don't you know I don't want visitors?

355
00:22:24,470 --> 00:22:27,000
- Everyone, please leave. Now!
- Okay.

356
00:22:30,107 --> 00:22:31,107
What?

357
00:22:31,402 --> 00:22:32,578
Want me to hit you some more?

358
00:22:34,745 --> 00:22:38,000
- Honestly, this girl...
- Why did you have to interfere?

359
00:22:42,272 --> 00:22:44,324
What kind of act is she putting on now?

360
00:22:45,637 --> 00:22:48,003
Mother, Father.

361
00:22:48,738 --> 00:22:51,910
I never meant to hurt Ji Hu.

362
00:22:53,382 --> 00:22:55,270
Father, you know that.

363
00:22:55,692 --> 00:22:57,993
You know how much I love Ji Hu.

364
00:23:00,405 --> 00:23:02,061
If it weren't for Na Ji Ni,

365
00:23:02,382 --> 00:23:05,162
Ji Hu and I would be married by now.

366
00:23:05,510 --> 00:23:06,510
Right?

367
00:23:07,524 --> 00:23:09,095
I hated Na Ji Ni.

368
00:23:10,165 --> 00:23:12,551
I hated her so much I wanted to kill her.

369
00:23:14,638 --> 00:23:18,352
I never imagined
Ji Hu would get caught up in it.

370
00:23:19,885 --> 00:23:24,612
I love Ji Hu.

371
00:23:25,537 --> 00:23:26,958
I love him.

372
00:23:29,052 --> 00:23:33,179
I'm sorry. Father, I'm so sorry.

373
00:23:33,838 --> 00:23:36,385
Whatever your reasons were,
we can't forgive you.

374
00:23:37,005 --> 00:23:40,447
You'll have to face the consequences
of drinking and acting recklessly.

375
00:23:42,339 --> 00:23:44,577
- Let's go.
- Father.

376
00:24:14,945 --> 00:24:16,018
Hello?

377
00:24:17,477 --> 00:24:18,759
Yes, this is Na Ji Ni.

378
00:24:19,546 --> 00:24:20,885
The dashcam footage?

379
00:24:22,159 --> 00:24:23,650
Okay, got it. I'll be right there.

380
00:24:24,489 --> 00:24:25,489
Okay.

381
00:24:28,891 --> 00:24:30,625
(Jong No Police Station)

382
00:24:40,992 --> 00:24:44,635
The driver's blood alcohol level
indicated severe intoxication.

383
00:24:45,245 --> 00:24:46,777
Isn't this attempted murder?

384
00:24:46,832 --> 00:24:48,317
She clearly did it on purpose.

385
00:24:48,742 --> 00:24:50,085
I'm pressing charges.

386
00:24:50,131 --> 00:24:52,495
She's been trying to kill my daughter
for years!

387
00:24:53,392 --> 00:24:55,543
What on earth is going on between them?

388
00:24:57,570 --> 00:24:58,570
Ji Ni!

389
00:25:01,165 --> 00:25:03,865
Please make sure she's punished.
I'm begging you.

390
00:25:12,625 --> 00:25:13,729
What's wrong with Do Hee?

391
00:25:35,552 --> 00:25:36,552
Ji Ni.

392
00:25:38,745 --> 00:25:40,686
If Do Do Hee gets away with it again,

393
00:25:41,419 --> 00:25:43,183
I think I'll really kill her.

394
00:25:44,656 --> 00:25:45,656
Forget it.

395
00:25:46,158 --> 00:25:47,957
Why should you get your hands dirty?

396
00:25:48,394 --> 00:25:49,394
I'll do it.

397
00:25:49,811 --> 00:25:52,384
Your dad couldn't do it,
so I'll take care of it this time.

398
00:25:53,965 --> 00:25:55,210
That crazy girl.

399
00:25:57,985 --> 00:25:59,091
Mom, go.

400
00:25:59,640 --> 00:26:00,748
Ji Ni.

401
00:26:01,190 --> 00:26:04,142
Why go there?
They won't even let you visit.

402
00:26:04,332 --> 00:26:05,776
Just go home and get some rest.

403
00:26:07,609 --> 00:26:08,690
Ji Ni.

404
00:26:18,488 --> 00:26:20,388
(ICU 2)

405
00:26:21,598 --> 00:26:23,536
Ji Ni, breathe. Don't be afraid.

406
00:26:23,538 --> 00:26:24,578
Ji Ni, look at me.

407
00:26:29,918 --> 00:26:31,965
I feel alive.

408
00:26:32,585 --> 00:26:34,742
There were so many times I wanted to die,

409
00:26:36,439 --> 00:26:37,439
but you make me want to live.

410
00:26:40,192 --> 00:26:41,518
The person...

411
00:26:42,490 --> 00:26:44,138
who brings out my honest self.

412
00:26:45,950 --> 00:26:47,361
The person who keeps me alive.

413
00:26:48,945 --> 00:26:49,965
So the person...

414
00:26:51,257 --> 00:26:52,873
I can't help but love.

415
00:26:55,391 --> 00:26:56,391
It's you, Ji Ni.

416
00:26:59,886 --> 00:27:00,955
Ji Hu.

417
00:27:02,562 --> 00:27:03,592
I...

418
00:27:06,715 --> 00:27:07,846
I...

419
00:28:29,721 --> 00:28:33,196
(Family Register)

420
00:28:33,262 --> 00:28:34,658
What if he never wakes up?

421
00:28:34,695 --> 00:28:36,792
What if Ji Hu leaves us like this...

422
00:28:36,800 --> 00:28:39,464
Get lost! I don't even want to see you!

423
00:28:39,465 --> 00:28:41,750
Please, can't you let me see Ji Hu?

424
00:28:41,752 --> 00:28:43,372
You're an idiot, and so am I.

425
00:28:43,373 --> 00:28:45,079
Isn't that why we connected?

426
00:28:45,080 --> 00:28:47,710
She tried to kill someone.
There's no excuse for that.

427
00:28:47,712 --> 00:28:50,196
Want me to hit your daughter too?
See how it feels?

428
00:28:50,197 --> 00:28:51,890
I like you too!

429
00:28:51,892 --> 00:28:53,921
So please, wake up. Please.

430
00:28:55,005 --> 00:28:57,005
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
